{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30009_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0b7f774b23309d281397e2310fb183a676be8651b29082fe6f59cf20259a139f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56fd3eb8a51c564193cf73329731219bd340177eb3edbba4ad87299bf87c6790",
      "text": "Being there for you.",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3daf22f1e69bdfc5b155624f9e0058e14b2a0733a43f0ca6cb07f480c1d5af1a",
      "text": "某天，FRAME接到了拍摄婚纱杂志的工作。\n对方似乎是看中了他们曾为公务员的“可靠感”才发来的邀约。\n然而，三人却怎么也无法把握具体的感觉……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000012:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000012:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56fd3eb8a51c564193cf73329731219bd340177eb3edbba4ad87299bf87c6790",
      "text": "Being there for you.",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33619ad29c185ff252c3a0aedb7eb6a3c0b792f9c6f6fa843c955ad8e4adc121",
      "text": "……啊！\n这边，这边！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b99371b17d327422866bf101fad860272efc92b8f36ec9ddc80ab32f05570599",
      "text": "早上好！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4418baab9de21d47da52925fe2a3cb0ecd6555824ec9532ef7cd93fa7435320a",
      "text": "哎？你说因为纠结穿什么衣服和弄什么发型，\n结果赶在最后一秒才到……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9bfb6dc496e923e60374e02c0c638c43163d146cfdb1d61da0851cfa3f67450",
      "text": "原来是这样啊。不过时间刚刚好哦。\n用不着这么着急忙慌的啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6f1388b7bec441655a5b25353be2a6f26e05d5716e7df1695b02d13b41dfcf8",
      "text": "……哎？因为我发消息说到了？\n想早点见到我……哈哈，莫名有点害羞呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c01eb1dfd3fd192410da1001e66334b14af0ca808fa72aae0c77b6a5d270144",
      "text": "不过，我也是一样的心情哦。\n因为太期待今天的约会，甚至都失眠了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04caf849dd781cd7de9286bbbcc2b6b66fd5594a64446d433e9c012789f6e4a6",
      "text": "好像催得太急了，真不好意思啊。\n今天就痛痛快快玩个够吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93e9b649853bd49b4d0b8a1d1832be9572c72b816c88472f9ffb03be1957d76a",
      "text": "本来还有点担心天气，\n今天能放晴真是太好了！真是绝佳的约会好日子。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30009_01:1_3_30009_01_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:108a157ba4354742af647b4922cf9757a2e3d34bf1b731c9b082713216edf4d3",
      "text": "那么，我们差不多该出发了吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
